er":[],"premium_blob_repeater":[],"pa_badge_text":"New","pa_condition_repeater":[],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text"},"elements":[{"id":"9ab1082","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"pa_condition_repeater":[],"premium_tooltip_text":"Hi, I'm a global tooltip.","premium_tooltip_position":"top,bottom","premium_parallax_layers_list":[],"premium_gradient_colors_repeater":[],"premium_kenburns_repeater":[],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","premium_mscroll_repeater":[]},"elements":[{"id":"48889de3","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h1><span style="font-weight: 400;">Clear Day Bath Solutions Privacy Policy</span></h1><p><b>Online Privacy Policy URL:</b> <a href="https://cleardaybaths.com/privacy-policy/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">https://cleardaybaths.com/privacy-policy/</span></a></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Who We Are </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our website address is: </span><a href="https://cleardaybaths.com/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">https://cleardaybaths.com/</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">. </span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Clear Day Bath Solutions </span></p><h2><b>What Personal Information We Collect</b></h2><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">To remain transparent and fully compliant with carrier guidelines, here is the clear breakdown of the information we collect:</span></p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Comment Information:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> When visitors leave comments on the site, we collect the data shown in the comments form, along with the visitor’s IP address and browser user agent string. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Gravatar Hashes:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be provided to the Gravatar service. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>User Profile Data:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> For users that register on our website (if any), we store the personal information they provide in their user profile. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Media Uploads:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> If you upload images to the website, you should avoid uploading images with embedded location data (EXIF GPS) included, as visitors can download and extract this data. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Cookies:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> * If you leave a comment, you may opt-in to saving your name, email address, and website in cookies. </span><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="2"><span style="font-weight: 400;">When visiting our login page, a temporary cookie is set to verify if your browser accepts cookies. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="2"><span style="font-weight: 400;">When logging in, several cookies are established to save your login information and screen display choices. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="2"><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie indicating the post ID is saved in your browser. </span></li></ul></li></ul><h2><b>How Personal Information Is Used</b></h2><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We use the collected data to maintain site functionality, improve user experience, and ensure security:</span></p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Spam Prevention:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Visitor IP addresses and browser strings are utilized to help spam detection. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Profile Customization:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> After approval of your comment, your profile picture is visible to the public in the context of your comment via the Gravatar service. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>User Convenience:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Cookies are utilized so that you do not have to fill in your details again when you leave another comment. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Session Management:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Cookies manage your account visibility, with login cookies persisting for two days (or two weeks if "Remember Me" is selected) and screen options lasting for a year. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Automated Comment Processing:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Comment metadata is used so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue. </span></li></ul><h2><b>Who Personal Information Is Shared With</b></h2><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We protect your data and only share it under explicit parameters:</span></p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Automated Spam Services:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam detection service. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Site Administration:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Website administrators can see and edit user profile information. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Account Security:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Third-Party Platforms &amp; Integrations:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> * The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: </span><a href="https://automattic.com/privacy/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">https://automattic.com/privacy/</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">. </span><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="2"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g., videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website. These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website. </span></li></ul></li><li class="li1"><b>SMS Data Protection &amp; Non-Disclosure: </b>Mobile phone numbers and SMS consent are used solely within Clear Day Bath Solutions' own direct business operations to contact you, including for marketing purposes where you have consented. We do not sell, rent, or share your phone number or SMS consent with third parties or affiliates for their own marketing or promotional purposes.</li></ul><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">How Long We Retain Your Data </span></p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">For users that register on our website (if any), we store the personal information they provide in their user profile. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Cookie Durations:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> * Comment-saver cookies last for one year. </span><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="2"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Temporary login cookies contain no personal data and are discarded when you close your browser. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="2"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Login cookies last for two days, and screen options cookies last for a year. If you log out of your account, the login cookies will be removed. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="2"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Article edit tracking cookies expire after 1 day. </span></li></ul></li></ul><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">What Rights You Have Over Your Data </span></p><ul><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes. </span></li><li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). </span></li></ul><h2><b>Mobile Messaging Privacy &amp; Data Protection</b></h2><p class="p1">Mobile numbers collected for text messaging purposes, and the corresponding opt-in consent, are used only within Clear Day Bath Solutions' own direct business operations. Depending on the consent you provide, we may use your number to contact you for transactional and marketing purposes related to our products and services. We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile number or opt-in consent with third parties, affiliates, or outside service providers for their own marketing or promotional purposes. Any platform we use to send messages on our behalf acts only as our service provider and is not permitted to use your information for its own purposes.</p>","pa_condition_repeater":[],"premium_tooltip_text":"Hi, I'm a global tooltip.","premium_tooltip_position":"top,bottom","premium_gradient_colors_repeater":[],"premium_kenburns_repeater":[],"pa_cursor_ftext":"Premium Follow Text","pa_badge_text":"New","premium_mscroll_repeater":[]},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"99e8fab","elType":"section","settings":{"background_background":"classic","margin":{"unit":"%","top":"0","right":0,"bottom":"0",