<p class="p2"><b>Last Updated:</b> June 05, 2026</p>
<p class="p2">Welcome to Clear Day Baths. These Terms and Conditions (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of the products, services, and website provided by Clear Day Baths (“Company,” “we,” “us,” or Our”). By scheduling a consultation, purchasing our products, or hiring us for services, you agree to be bound by these Terms. Please read them carefully.</p>

<h2 class="p3"><b>1. Acceptance of Terms</b></h2>
<p class="p2">By engaging with Clear Day Baths’ products and services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms, as well as our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use our services or website.</p>

<h2 class="p3"><b>2. Scope of Services</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>2.1.</b> Clear Day Baths provides professional bathroom remodeling services, custom installations, and related products.</li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>2.2.</b> You agree to use our website, services, and products only for lawful purposes and in strict compliance with all local, state, and federal laws and regulations.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>3. Payment, Fees, and Estimates</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>3.1.</b> Payment terms, including deposits, milestone payments, and final balances, will be outlined explicitly in your service contract or invoice. All payments are due strictly in accordance with those terms.</li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>3.2.</b> You are responsible for any applicable taxes, permit fees, or municipal assessments associated with the products and remodeling services provided to you.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>4. Intellectual Property</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>4.1.</b> All content, website materials, marketing designs, logos, images, and intellectual property displayed on <a href="https://cleardaybaths.com/"><span class="s1">https://cleardaybaths.com/</span></a> or provided during your consultation remain the exclusive property of Clear Day Baths unless otherwise noted.</li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>4.2.</b> You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or use our proprietary materials or intellectual property without our prior written consent.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>5. Confidentiality</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>5.1.</b> Any proprietary or personal information shared between you and Clear Day Baths during the scope of consultation and project delivery will be kept confidential and will not be disclosed to unauthorized third parties without your explicit consent, except as required by law.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>6. Warranties and Project Satisfaction</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>6.1.</b> Material and labor warranties vary by project and product type. Specific warranty details, coverages, and durations will be explicitly detailed in your product agreement or service contract.</li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>6.2.</b> For information regarding materials, cancellations, or modifications prior to the start of installation, please consult your project agreement or speak directly with our team.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>7. Limitation of Liability</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>7.1.</b> To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Clear Day Baths, its officers, employees, and subcontractors shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising out of or in connection with the use or inability to use our products and services.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>8. Termination of Service</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>8.1.</b> Clear Day Baths reserves the right to terminate, suspend, or cancel service agreements, estimates, or access to our digital platforms at our sole discretion, with or without cause, subject to the terms of any active, binding service contracts.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>9. Modifications to Terms</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>9.1.</b> We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time without prior notice. The updated version will become effective immediately upon being posted on our website (<a href="https://cleardaybaths.com/"><span class="s1">https://cleardaybaths.com/</span></a>). Your continued engagement with our services constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>10. SMS/Text Messaging Terms</b></h2>
<p class="p1">By providing your mobile phone number to Clear Day Bath Solutions and checking a consent box — you opt in and agree to receive text messages from us.</p>

<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li2"><b>Expected Message Types: </b>You may receive both transactional and marketing messages, including appointment reminders, scheduling updates, project status notifications, account notifications, and promotional messages regarding our products, services, and offers.</li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>Contact Methods: </b>Depending on the consent you provide, we may contact you using automated dialing technology, SMS/MMS messages, AI-generated voice, and prerecorded or artificial voice messages.</li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>Messaging frequency may vary.</b><b></b></li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>Message and data rates may apply.</b><b></b></li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>Use and Non-Disclosure of Your Information: </b>We use the information you provide only within our own direct business operations to contact you and deliver our services. We do not sell, rent, or share your phone number, SMS consent, or other personal information with third parties, affiliates, or outside service providers for their own marketing or promotional purposes.</li>
 	<li class="li2"><b>To opt out at any time, text STOP. </b>After texting STOP, you will receive one final message confirming your opt-out.</li>
 	<li class="li3">For assistance, text HELP or call 571-540-9957, or visit our website at https://cleardaybaths.com/.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p2"><b style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji';">11. Mobile Messaging Terms of Service</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
 	<li class="li1">By opting into text communication, you consent to receive transactional and promotional SMS messages from Clear Day Bath Solutions, including appointment reminders, project updates, account notifications, and messages regarding our products, services, and offers.</li>
 	<li class="li1">Message and data rates may apply for any messages sent or received.</li>
 	<li class="li1">Message frequency varies based on project tracking, promotional activity, and user interaction.</li>
 	<li class="li1">You can opt out of communication at any time by texting or replying STOP.</li>
 	<li class="li1">For operational support or customer care assistance, you can text or reply HELP or call 571-540-9957.</li>
 	<li class="li2">We use your information only within our own direct business operations. We do not sell, rent, or share your mobile number or SMS consent with third parties, affiliates, or outside service providers for their own marketing or promotional purposes.</li>
</ul>
<h2 class="p3"><b>12. Contact Information</b></h2>
<ul class="ul1">
